re base.","Actual related party transaction value exceeded estimates; monitor whether additional shareholder approval is required."],"earnings_en":"For the quarter ended 31 July 2026, revenue was MYR 45.0 million, up 27.1% QoQ and 151.0% YoY; net income was MYR 1.554 million, down 56.3% QoQ and 40.7% YoY, with a net margin of 3.5% versus 10.1% in the prior quarter."}